docs\phase-visual-audit.md:19:| WorldspaceUI | `WorldspaceUI` | OFF | Yes (SelectionHooks: 4 patches on SelectedUnit) | N/A (mesh-based) | Yes — per-actor rig graph with nameplates, HP bars, selection rings, damage popups | Minor | Nameplate requires sub-flag `WorldspaceLabel3D=false` (default OFF). Health bar has two modes: legacy (Sprites/Default quad) or 3D (WorldspaceHealth3D flag, uses voxel material). Selection ring and damage popup are mesh-based. `TextMesh3D` type resolved via reflection — if WorldBox doesn't ship it, falls back to Unity UI `Text` on a WorldSpace Canvas. **Issue:** WorldSpace Canvas labels can be very small or invisible at strategy zoom without careful sizing. |
